<BODY BGCOLOR="#000000" TEXT="#FFFFFF" LINK="#90FFFF" VLINK="#CCCCCC">
<FONT FACE="Arial,Helvetica">
<H3>
<CENTER>
<FONT COLOR="#FFFF00">Live Chat</FONT>
</CENTER></H3>

You can chat live to other Tipo 16V owners, providing they are online, by
using one of the many chat style applications available.
These products allow you to see who's currently online, send a quick &amp; private
instant message and best of all chat!.

<P>
<A HREF="http://www.aol.co.uk/aim/register/register.html" target="_blank"><IMG BORDER=0 SRC="aim.gif" width=175 height=100 alt="Instant Messenger" align=right></A>
AOL has a chat product called AIM which stands for AOL Instant Messager. You can download this by
clicking on the picture on the right. Here are full details about how to
<A HREF="http://www.aol.co.uk/aim/installwin32.html" target="_blank">install</A> and
<A HREF="http://www.aol.co.uk/aim/quicktips.html" target="_blank">use</A> the product.
Each person registered with AIM has a unique screen name. In the table below you
will find the screen name of each owner whose registered with AIM.
<P>

<A HREF="http://www.icq.com/download" target="_blank"><IMG BORDER=0 SRC="icq.gif" width=106 height=57 alt="ICQ" align=left></A>
Another popular chat product is called 
<A HREF="http://www.icq.com/index" target="_blank">ICQ</A>. Here instead of using a name 
when you register you are given a unique ICQ number, also known as a UIN (Universal
Internet Number). In the table below you should also find the owners ICQ if they
have one.

<BR CLEAR=ALL>
<P>

